      <p class="_abstract">Using boot image skew enforcement, you can ensure that the boot images in a cluster are up-to-date with the OpenShift Container Platform and RHCOS version being used in the cluster. Making sure that your boot images are current can help you avoid the problems associated with running older images.</p>
